   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Two African American people, a man in his early 60s and a woman in her late 50s, sitting on a brown leather couch reviewing paperwork.  They could be a married couple at home paying bills, or business associates in an office working on a project.  They are both wearing eyeglasses, and the woman is holding papers in her hands.  They are dressed in smart casual attire.  They are smiling at the camera.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
